<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45954" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-lĭgo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to bind</i> or <i>tie
				below</i>, <i>to bind on</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>; not in Cic.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syn. subnecto): vites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 33, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 22, 35, § 197</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lateri atque umeris ensem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 459</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clipeum sinistrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 445</span></i>
			; cf. <b>poet.</b>, transf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quem (virum) balteus asper Subligat,</span>”
				<i>girds</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5,
					579</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tiaram extremā cervice,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					700</span></i>
			 et saep.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subligata ludit,</span>”
				<i>trussed up</i>, <i>tucked up</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					7, 67, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
